.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt ZDOTS-ASK 1
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm zdots-ask
.Nd domain-aware prompt router for zdots local AI
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar options
.Ar prompt
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
selects a zdots domain prompt, optionally hydrates context from the knowledge
layer, and routes the request to local AI.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Fl
.It Fl -domain Ar domain
Force a domain.
.It Fl -pattern Ar pattern
Use a Fabric pattern.
.It Fl -context Op Ar tag
Prepend
.Xr zdots-ctx 1
hydrate output.
.It Fl -think
Enable thinking mode.
.It Fl -dry-run
Print detected domain and prompt without inference.
.It Fl -list-domains
List domains.
.It Fl -list-patterns
List patterns.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTS_DOMAINS_FILE
.It Ev ZDOTDIR
Repository root.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_MODE
AI operating mode.
.It Ev ZDOTS_DOMAINS_FILE
Domain registry path.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ai-query 1 ,
.Xr zdots-ctx 1 ,
.Xr zdots-ai-stack 7
